            "review_text": "Hannah Le\nDublin, Ireland235 contributions\n0\nA gem in Ho Chi Minh city\nJan 2019 • Family\nThis is the best Japanese restaurant that we have been to so far in Ho Chi Minh city. The owner is the chef from a 5* hotel so he knows very well the requirements for quality of the food, presentation, customers services, etc. Also the greatest thing is that all these best things come with a great value for money, much better than other Japanese restaurants that have the similar quality of food. The portion is big enough and you can get food with very reasonable amount of money. We came here for my husband’s birthday and will definitely come back when we come back to HCM next time.\nRead more\nWritten January 13, 2019",
