            "review_text": "N.N.Tuyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nDisappointing\nMar 2018 • Friends\nI went to this new Japanese restaurant after a friend who highly recommended it. \n\nI wished it was as good as advertised. I went for lunch to this small place and upon entrance, there was this awful smell. I complained about it and they said they were making some sauce. It smelled like rotten flesh. \n\nI ordered a lunch sushi set and it was so average. Nothing special and I lost appetite from the smell. \n\nIt was obvious they set this place up on a budget. It’s just an average japanese place like many in saigon.\nRead more\nWritten June 16, 2018",
